          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b11771-LsttI1dS8fy1.jpg"
        },
        "description": "Prince of Pars. \n\nArslan is frequently misinterpreted by those around him as being a weakling, because of his effete appearance, naivete, compassion, and optimism. While these are true to a point, Arslan is also philosophical, intelligent, and charismatic, able to rally even the most apathetic of people to his cause. \n\nHe is dedicated to his friends, especially [Daryun](https://anilist.co/character/14126/Daryun), at one time threatening to kill an ally who had got Daryun into a particularly nasty situation.",
