        },
        "description": "Aloof, defiant, strong, and cool; Pharangese is both a dedicated cleric to the goddess Misra, and the most-skilled female fighter on the planet. She maintains her mystique throughout the course of the story, so that little is known of her personally. According to her own account, she was the most beautiful, intelligent and capable member of her order; when a prediction was made that a servant of Misra must protect [Prince Arislan](https://anilist.co/character/11771/Arslan), the other clerics selected her to go, out of jealousy.",
