        },
        "description": "Prince of the Eastern Kingdom of Sindhura and younger brother to Gadevi. Rajendra is best described as rash, self-centered, and non-trustworthy to some degree, although as such he is constantly squabbling with his brother, he does appear later on to genuinely care for his kingdom and his people, wishing for safety and glory alike for his people.\n\n~!When he first appears, he intended to prove himself worthy by defeating Arslan...only to be bested and lead into an alliance with the young Parsian Prince. Their alliance proves fruitful, and sure enough, Rajendra comes to rely on his unlikely ally.!~\n\n(Source: MAL)",
